A copy or a derivation is marked as a node an object holds, its first child read as a holder.
A revoke that clears it would call on an object that holds nothing;
only an object holds a node that names a holder.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work test qemu-replay
Report: a call bound a thread its caller could not control to units
Witness: fuzz actor-handoff

